A||||1||burdell1||Fusible Links
Z||000000||burdell1||08-11-99||05:56 PM||||I need to replace the fusible link for the my headlights but I cannot find any fusible links that link one wire to two wires. Do they sell such links? Do I have to make my own? if I have to make my own, how do I do it ?
Z||000001||Cooter||08-11-99||08:14 PM||||I just cut out the fusible link wire and spliced in a blade type fuse holder in its place. Makes it a lot easier to replace blown circuits later. I think I have 15 amp fuses in the headlights- if that is what you were wondering about.
